get-declined-transaction
meta {
    doc: """
    GET /declined_transactions/{declined_transaction_id}: retrieve a
    Declined Transaction.

    **Example**

    ```hot
    declined ::increase::transactions/get-declined-transaction("declined_transaction_17jbn0yyhvkt4v4ooym8")
